# Keeps this directory present after checkout.
#
# TestBaseLocal.SetUpForTests() and TestBaseServer.SetUpForTests()
# (newtelligence.DasBlog.Runtime.Test) both assert this directory exists
# before running any test in their fixtures. The .csproj already declares
# it (<Folder Include="TestLogs\" />) but an EMPTY directory is not
# representable in git, so a fresh checkout never had it — every test in
# both fixtures failed its TestFixtureSetUp with "Expected: True, But was:
# False" until this placeholder was added. See asop/runs/feed/v1/EVIDENCE.md.
